  data: {
    LLM: "Tell the truth when the pile is small. There is little reward and high risk to lying when only 4 cards are in the center. Save your big bluffs for when you have a 10-card hand of junk and the pile is massive.\n\nThe 'Pile-Seeding' Maneuver: If you have four Jacks, and the current rank is Jacks, play all four of them truthful. This 'cleans' the pile for you and ensures the next player MUST lie (as you have all the Jacks). If you call 'Fool!' on them immediately, they take the pile you just emptied.\n\nBody-Language Reading: Most players have a 'tell' when playing multiple cards. Watch for the timing of their hand movement. If they play three cards as 'Aces' very slowly, they are likely searching for a lie.",
    Player: "Tell the truth when the pile is small. There is little reward and high risk to lying when only 4 cards are in the center. Save your big bluffs for when you have a 10-card hand of junk and the pile is massive.\n\nThe 'Pile-Seeding' Maneuver: If you have four Jacks, and the current rank is Jacks, play all four of them truthful. This 'cleans' the pile for you and ensures the next player MUST lie (as you have all the Jacks). If you call 'Fool!' on them immediately, they take the pile you just emptied.\n\nBody-Language Reading: Most players have a 'tell' when playing multiple cards. Watch for the timing of their hand movement. If they play three cards as 'Aces' very slowly, they are likely searching for a lie.",
